<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Devex plans 1-11 share buyback.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Devex plans 1-11 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner Devex Ltd said on Thursday its previously announced share buyback would proceed on a 1-for-11 basis, with each share to be priced at 55 cents.</p>
<p>It said this payment represented a 28 percent premium over the average share market price over the last 30 days.</p>
<p>Shareholder approval would be sought at the annual meeting on November 18, with the offer closing on December 19.</p>
<p>Devex has 124.262 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Its shares closed at 44 cents on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
